reaks `helm-diff` which relies on helm able to return `2` when `helm-diff` returned `2`.\r\n\r\nThis is a regression since helm-3.0.0-beta.5. The problem is exactly the same as #6384, which had been fixed in helm-3.0.0-beta.4 via #6385, but was reintroduced to helm-3.0.0-beta.5 via #6341.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nOutput of `helm version`:\r\n\r\n```\r\nversion.BuildInfo{Version:\"v3.0.0-beta.5\", GitCommit:\"509a8819b7e8dba86b7982c006fce22628aeea28\", GitTreeState:\"clean\", GoVersion:\"go1.13.3\"}\r\n```\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"adamreese","id":2347529,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNDc1Mjk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2347529?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamreese","html_url":"https://github.com/adamreese","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamreese/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamreese/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamreese/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamreese/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamreese/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamreese/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamreese/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamreese/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamreese/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helm/helm/issues/6788/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helm/helm/issues/6788/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}